[
  {
    "content_id": "10055001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我保羅奉上帝的旨意，按照在基督耶穌裡應許的生命作基督耶穌的使徒，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;寫信給我親愛的兒子提摩太。 願父上帝和我們的主基督耶穌賜給你恩典、憐憫和平安！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我日夜不停地為你禱告，對我效法祖先用清潔的良心事奉的上帝充滿了感恩。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;每逢想起你流淚的情形，我就渴望見你，好使我的心充滿喜樂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;我記得你那真誠無偽的信心。你外祖母羅以和你母親友妮基首先有了這信心，我深信你也有。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;因此我提醒你，要把上帝在我給你按手時賜給你的恩賜充分發揮出來。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;因為上帝賜給我們的不是怯懦的心，而是剛強、仁愛、自律的心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;所以，你不要羞於為我們的主作見證，也不要以我這為主被囚的人為恥，要靠著上帝的能力和我一同為福音受苦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;上帝拯救了我們，並呼召我們過聖潔的生活，不是因為我們的行為，而是出於祂的旨意和恩典。早在萬古以前，祂就在基督耶穌裡把這恩典賜給我們了，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;如今藉著我們救主基督耶穌的降世顯明了出來。基督已經消滅死亡，藉著福音將不朽的生命彰顯了出來。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我為了這福音受委派做傳道人、使徒和教師。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我因此遭受這些苦難，但我不以為恥，因為我知道我所信的是誰，也深信祂能保守祂所託付我的，一直到那日。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你要以在基督耶穌裡的信心和愛心，把從我這裡聽到的純正教導當作典範遵守，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;要靠著住在我們裡面的聖靈牢牢守住交託給你的善道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你知道幾乎所有亞細亞的人都離棄了我，其中包括腓吉路和黑摩其尼。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;願主憐憫阿尼色弗一家人，他常常鼓勵我，不以我被囚禁為恥。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;他在羅馬的時候千方百計尋訪我的下落，直到找著我為止。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55001018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;你清楚知道，他從前在以弗所怎樣在各個方面服侍我。願主再來時憐憫他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我兒啊！你要靠著基督耶穌的恩典剛強起來。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;以前你在許多見證人面前聽過我的教導，你要把這些教導傳給忠信可靠、能教導他人的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你要作基督耶穌的精兵，與我同受苦難。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;當兵的若讓其他事務纏身，就不能取悅徵召他的上司。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;同樣，參加比賽的人若不遵守比賽規則，就不可能得獎。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;辛勞的農夫理當先享受收成。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你要思想我說的話，因為主必使你領悟這一切。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;你要切記我所傳的福音：耶穌基督是大衛的後裔，祂從死裡復活了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我為這福音受苦，甚至像犯人一樣被囚禁，但上帝的道是囚禁不住的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我為了上帝的選民忍受一切痛苦，使他們可以獲得在基督耶穌裡的救恩和永遠的榮耀。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;有真實可信的話說： 「我們若與基督同死， 就必與祂同活。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我們若忍耐到底， 就必與祂一同作王。 我們若不承認祂， 祂也必不承認我們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;我們縱然會失信， 祂仍然信實可靠， 因為祂不能否認自己。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你要提醒眾人這些事，在上帝面前囑咐他們：不要為言詞爭辯，因為那對聽見的人有害無益。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你應當竭力在上帝面前做經得起考驗、問心無愧的工人，正確講解真理之道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;要遠避一切世俗的空談，因為好空談的人只會越來越不敬虔。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;他們講的話像毒瘡越爛越大，許米乃和腓理徒就是例子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;他們離經背道，說復活的事已成過去，動搖了一些人的信心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;然而，上帝所立的堅實根基屹立不搖，這根基上刻著：「主認識那些屬於祂的人」，「凡承認主名的人都要離棄罪惡。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;大戶人家不但有金器銀器，也有木器瓦器，這些器皿的用途有貴賤之分。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;人若潔身自愛，遠離卑賤的事，就必成為聖潔無瑕的貴重器皿，可以被主用來成就各種善事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;你要逃避年輕人的邪情私慾，要跟那些以清潔的心求告主的人一同追求公義、信心、仁愛、和平。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 2:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002023",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;不要參與愚昧無知的辯論，因為你知道這些事只會引起紛爭。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 2:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002024",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;主的奴僕不可與人爭執，總要溫和待人，善於教導，心存忍耐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 2:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002025",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;要溫柔地規勸那些反對的人，也許上帝會賜給他們悔改的心，使他們明白真理，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055002026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 2:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55002026",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;讓他們這些被魔鬼擄去、受其擺佈的人能夠醒悟過來，脫離魔鬼的網羅。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;你要知道，末世必有艱難的日子，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;因為那時的人都自私自利、貪愛錢財、狂妄自誇、驕傲自負、譭謗褻瀆、違背父母、忘恩負義、心不聖潔、</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;冷漠無情、不願和解、好說讒言、毫無節制、蠻橫兇暴、不愛良善、</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;出賣朋友、任意妄為、自高自大、沉溺享樂、不愛上帝，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;徒有敬虔的外表，卻無敬虔的實質。你要避開這樣的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;這些人溜進別人家裡，哄騙那些意志薄弱的婦女。那些婦女心中充滿罪惡，受各種邪情私慾驅使，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;雖然常常學習，卻始終不能明白真理。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;現在這些人敵對真理，就像從前雅尼和佯庇反對摩西一樣，他們的心思壞透了，他們的信仰是虛假的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;不過，他們猖狂不了多久，因為他們的愚昧行徑必暴露在眾人面前，就像雅尼和佯庇的下場一樣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;但你熟知我的教導、言行、志向、信心、忍耐、愛心、毅力，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;也知道我在安提阿、以哥念、路司得遭遇了何等的迫害和苦難。但主從這一切患難中救了我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;其實凡立志在基督耶穌裡過敬虔生活的人都會受到迫害。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;而惡人和騙子會變本加厲地作惡，迷惑人，也被人迷惑。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;但你要堅守自己所學所信的，因為你知道是跟誰學的，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;並且你從小就熟悉聖經。聖經能給你智慧，使你藉著信基督耶穌而得救。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;聖經全部是上帝啟示的，有益於教導、督責、使人歸正、培養人行義，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55003017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;使屬上帝的人得到充分的裝備，去行各種善事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;在上帝和審判活人死人的基督耶穌面前，我憑基督的顯現和祂的國鄭重囑咐你：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;務要傳道，無論時機好壞，都要準備好，以百般的忍耐和教導督責人、警戒人、勉勵人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;因為有一天，人們會厭倦純正的教導，耳朵發癢，尋找許多迎合他們私慾的老師。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;他們掩耳不聽真理，反而偏向無稽之談。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;然而，你要謹慎行事，不怕吃苦，專心傳道，盡忠職守。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我的生命如同奉獻在祭壇上的酒正傾倒出來，我離世的日子快要到了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;那美好的仗，我打過了；當跑的路，我跑完了；所信的道，我守住了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;從此，有公義的冠冕為我預備，按公義審判的主會在祂來的那一天把它賜給我，不但會賜給我，也會賜給所有愛慕祂顯現的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;請你儘快到我這裡來，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;因為底馬貪愛世界，離棄我跑到帖撒羅尼迦去了。革勒士去了加拉太，提多去了撻馬太，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;只剩下路加一人在我身邊。你要把馬可一起帶來，因為他在傳道的工作上對我很有幫助。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;至於推基古，我派他到以弗所去了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你來的時候，要把我在特羅亞時留給加布的外衣帶來，也要帶來那些書卷，特別是那些羊皮卷。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;銅匠亞歷山大做了許多惡事害我，主必按他的所作所為報應他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你也要提防他，因為他極力反對我們所傳的道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;我第一次在法庭申辯的時候，沒有人幫助我，眾人都離棄了我，但願他們不會因此而獲罪。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 4:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;然而主站在我身旁加給我力量，使我可以把福音完整地傳給所有的外族人。主把我從獅子口裡救了出來。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 4:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;主必救我脫離一切邪惡的攻擊，帶我進入祂的天國。願榮耀歸給主，直到永永遠遠。阿們！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 4:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;請代我問候百基拉和亞居拉，以及阿尼色弗一家。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 4:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;以拉都留在了哥林多，我把生病的特羅非摩留在了米利都。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 4:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;你要儘快在冬天之前趕到這裡來。友布羅、布田、利奴、革勞底亞和眾弟兄姊妹都問候你。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10055004022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "提摩太後書 4:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "55004022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;願主與你的靈同在！願恩典與你們同在！</p>"
  }
]